<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: African Development Bank loan to Cape Verde.</title>
<headline>African Development Bank loan to Cape Verde.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The African Development Bank said on Wednesday that it was lending Cape Verde $4.9 million to repair some 80 km (50 miles) of roads on four of its islands.</p>
<p>The loan will fund all the foreign currency costs of the project, representing 90 percent of the total cost.</p>
<p>The Cape Verde islands, situated to the west of Africa off Senegal, will have 50 years to repay, with 10 years grace.</p>
</text>
